  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNEP Icke HCFC-studie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP Non-HCFC study - Non-HCFC study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFCs have less ozone depleting potential than CFCs, but they are also climate gases. Therefore Sweden had a very restricted policy on the use of HCFCs as alternatives to CFCs. Some developing countries have begun to put in place non-HCFC alternatives to CFCs. The planned publication from UNEP DTIE (http://www.uneptie.org/ozonaction/)will highlight these achievements.</narrative>
  </description>
